{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Obscure is a physics-based, first-person puzzle game. Command objects using the power of &quot;Light&quot; and explore the forgotten chambers of an old facility. Harness the Law of Inertia\u2014the first law of motion\u2014and manipulate objects with the help of your flashlight. We aim to bring a fresh perspective to the puzzle genre, a mixture of both lively and realistic mechanics.<br><br>As you progress, uncover secrets and prepare yourself for mind-boggling puzzles. Prepare yourself for an atmospheric steampunk experience. May the light guide you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BREAKING GEARS!!!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>S-8 GRAVITON</i> is a groundbreaking invention from Quark Corp. It enlarges when exposed to light and shrinks back to its original size when the lights turn off. Size sometimes matters!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/scale_object.gif?t=1745702739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While our beloved <i>S-8 GRAVITON</i> changes its size, its weight also changes accordingly. But keep in mind \u2014 excess of anything is bad.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/chain_break.gif?t=1745702739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <i>S-8 GRAVITON</i> is now levitating \u2014 thanks to our cutting-edge technology, the &quot;<i>F-0 FLUX</i>&quot; Not your usual flashlight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/focus_mode.gif?t=1745702739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But sometimes, it becomes just an ordinary flashlight, helping you open gates. Here at Quark Corp, everything is high-tech \u2014 so you won\u2019t need to search for keys.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/mode_change.gif?t=1745702739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>L-3 PHOTON</i> is just an ordinary sidekick of <i>S-8 GRAVITON</i> . It abosrbs light and emits it. What a copycat!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/light_object.gif?t=1745702739\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692740?t=1745702739","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692740?t=1745702739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/6ea8bc6e58e3758066fd9a179c9d6f395b207ad5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745702739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/6ea8bc6e58e3758066fd9a179c9d6f395b207ad5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745702739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Obscure is a physics-based, first-person puzzle game. Command objects using the power of &quot;Light&quot; and explore the forgotten chambers of an old facility. Harness the Law of Inertia\u2014the first law of motion\u2014and manipulate objects with the help of your flashlight. We aim to bring a fresh perspective to the puzzle genre, a mixture of both lively and realistic mechanics.<br><br>As you progress, uncover secrets and prepare yourself for mind-b