ust an ordinary sidekick of <i>S-8 GRAVITON</i> . It abosrbs light and emits it. What a copycat!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/light_object.gif?t=1745702739\" /></p>","developers":["Vignette Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/c9d7e8e4061ffa017c569596e84361b5e7b3650f/header.jpg?t=1745702739","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130131,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130131/movie480.mp4?t=1745590887","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130131/movie_max.mp4?t=1745590887"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130131/52d6307416fefb7718e32407d75cf4a5371a643d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745590887","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130131/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745590887","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130131/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745590887"}}],"name":"Project OBSCURE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</str